<section id="A1.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.7 </span>More Visual Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present some visualizations of GPO-V attack cases.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.SS7.fig1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2605.07399v1/Figure12.png" id="A1.SS7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:333/338;" width="333" height="338" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
