<section id="A1.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.8 </span>Evaluation Criteria of GPO-V</h3>

<div id="A1.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To quantify the harmfulness of the generated responses, we introduce two metrics: A-HS and H-HS. For A-HS, we leverage GPT-4o from OpenAI as an automated evaluator. The specific evaluation prompt template is provided in Figure.<a href="#A1.SS8" title="A.8 Evaluation Criteria of GPO-V ‣ Appendix A Technical Appendices ‣ GPO-V: Jailbreak Diffusion Vision Language Model by Global Probability Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.8</span></a>. For H-HS, we employ human graders who adhere to the identical scoring rubric to ensure evaluative consistency across both AI and human assessments.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.SS8.fig1" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2605.07399v1/Figure15.svg" id="A1.SS8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:381/403;" width="381" height="403"></object>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
